---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Where Are You?" description="Find your starting point on the journey from OK to Great">
  <section class="hero-diagnostic">
    <h1>Where are <span class="highlight">you</span>?</h1>
    <p>Every organisation is somewhere on the journey from OK to Great. Find your starting point.</p>
  </section>
  
  <!-- The Journey Spectrum -->
  <section class="section spectrum-section">
    <div class="spectrum">
      <div class="spectrum-line"></div>
      
      <div class="spectrum-node" data-tenet="story">
        <div class="node-marker">1</div>
        <div class="node-content">
          <h3>Story</h3>
          <p class="node-pain">"We're losing to dumber competitors"</p>
          <p class="node-state">You have a great product but can't articulate why people should care.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="spectrum-node" data-tenet="clarity">
        <div class="node-marker">2</div>
        <div class="node-content">
          <h3>Clarity</h3>
          <p class="node-pain">"Our product is great but nobody gets it"</p>
          <p class="node-state">You can tell the story, but it's too complex. Simplification needed.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="spectrum-node" data-tenet="insight">
        <div class="node-marker">3</div>
        <div class="node-content">
          <h3>Insight</h3>
          <p class="node-pain">"We have data everywhere but no insight"</p>
          <p class="node-state">The message is clear internally. Now you need competitive intelligence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="spectrum-node" data-tenet="ai">
        <div class="node-marker">4</div>
        <div class="node-content">
          <h3>AI</h3>
          <p class="node-pain">"We know we should use AI but don't know how"</p>
          <p class="node-state">You're operationally solid. Time to leverage technology for advantage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="spectrum-node" data-tenet="growth">
        <div class="node-marker">5</div>
        <div class="node-content">
          <h3>Growth</h3>
          <p class="node-pain">"We're doing fine but could be doing better"</p>
          <p class="node-state">Everything works. Now it's about optimization and scale.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- How They Connect -->
  <section class="section connections-section">
    <h2 class="section-label">How They Connect</h2>
    <div class="connection-text">
      <p>
        These aren't rigid stages — organisations often work on multiple tenets simultaneously. 
        But there's a natural progression:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Story</strong> answers "Why do we exist?"</li>
        <li><strong>Clarity</strong> answers "How do we explain it?"</li>
        <li><strong>Insight</strong> answers "What's happening around us?"</li>
        <li><strong>AI</strong> answers "How do we work smarter?"</li>
        <li><strong>Growth</strong> answers "How do we get from OK to Great?"</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Each builds on the last. You can't effectively deploy AI without clarity. 
        You can't achieve clarity without story. And sustainable growth requires all four.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Quick Diagnostic -->
  <section class="section diagnostic-section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Quick Check</h2>
    <div class="diagnostic">
      <div class="diagnostic-question">
        <p>Which statement sounds most like your Monday morning?</p>
      </div>
      <div class="diagnostic-options">
        <a href="/story" class="diagnostic-option">
          <span class="option-icon">📖</span>
          <span class="option-text">"Why do they keep choosing the competition?"</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/clarity" class="diagnostic-option">
          <span class="option-icon">🔍</span>
          <span class="option-text">"Why can't we explain what we do simply?"</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/insight" class="diagnostic-option">
          <span class="option-icon">💡</span>
          <span class="option-text">"We have all this data but what does it mean?"</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/ai" class="diagnostic-option">
          <span class="option-icon">🤖</span>
          <span class="option-text">"Everyone's talking about AI but we're stuck"</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/growth" class="diagnostic-option">
          <span class="option-icon">📈</span>
          <span class="option-text">"Things are fine but we should be doing better"</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <h2>Not sure where to start?</h2>
    <p>Let's have a conversation. 30 minutes to find your biggest lever.</p>
    <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com" class="cta-button">Book a Call</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-diagnostic {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .hero-diagnostic h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .hero-diagnostic p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .spectrum-section {
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .spectrum {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .spectrum-line {
    position: absolute;
    left: 24px;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--accent), var(--border));
  }
  
  .spectrum-node {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  
  .spectrum-node:hover {
    transform: translateX(8px);
  }
  
  .node-marker {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  
  .spectrum-node:hover .node-marker {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #000;
  }
  
  .node-content {
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .node-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  
  .node-pain {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .node-state {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  
  .connection-text {
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  
  .connection-text p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .connection-text ul {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  
  .connection-text li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  
  .connection-text li::before {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .connection-text strong {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .diagnostic {
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  
  .diagnostic-question {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .diagnostic-question p {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  
  .diagnostic-options {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .diagnostic-option {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  
  .diagnostic-option:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
    background: #0f0f0f;
  }
  
  .option-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .option-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  
  .diagnostic-option:hover .option-text {
    color: var(--text);
  }
  
  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .cta-section h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .spectrum-node {
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    
    .node-marker {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  // Make nodes clickable
  document.querySelectorAll('.spectrum-node').forEach(node => {
    node.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const tenet = node.dataset.tenet;
      window.location.href = `/${tenet}`;
    });
  });
</script>
